OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Air Show 2025: All you
OL,4,Aneed to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are expected at
OL,7,FSouthport Air Show over the weekend for
OL,8,Fan event regarded as one of the UK's
OL,9,Fpremier air displays.
OL,11,FSefton Council said its programme would
OL,12,Fbe "spectacular" for "families,
OL,13,Ffriends, aviation buffs, and first-time
OL,14,Fvisitors alike".
OL,16,FIt promises high-tech jets, vintage
OL,17,Fwarplanes and daredevil stunts that can
OL,18,Fbe viewed either from the ticket-only
OL,19,Fcordoned-off beach area or any vantage
OL,20,Fpoint in the town.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
